ot/issues/comments/4820455994","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120636#issuecomment-4820455994","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120636","id":4820455994,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABH1JSOg","user":{"login":"Konserva-bruh","id":63848128,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzODQ4MTI4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63848128?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Konserva-bruh","html_url":"https://github.com/Konserva-bruh","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Konserva-bruh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Konserva-bruh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Konserva-bruh/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Konserva-bruh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Konserva-bruh/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Konserva-bruh/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Konserva-bruh/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Konserva-bruh/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Konserva-bruh/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-27T19:04:24Z","updated_at":"2026-06-27T19:09:37Z","body":"> Also weird, because I am on Wayland (see the system info in the original post)\n\nGodot uses x11 every time until it breaks, then it falls back to wayland (At least that's what I saw while was debugging) or until You enable this in editor\n\n<img width=\"1227\" height=\"856\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/652f1906-d6c6-4763-8829-4bc9548ebb3e\" />\n\n\n>EDIT: go sleep tonight ;)\n\nYeah, at least I did good job for this night🫡","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4820455994/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4825948619","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120636#issuecomment-4825948619","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120636","id":4825948619,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABH6Yhyw","user":{"login":"Konserva-bruh","id":63848128,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzODQ4MTI4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63848128?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Konserva-bruh","html_url":"https://github.com/Konserva-bruh","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Konserva-bruh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Konserva-bruh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Konserva-bruh/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Konserva-bruh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Konserva-bruh/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Konserva-bruh/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Konserva-bruh/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Konserva-bruh/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Konserva-bruh/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-28T11:29:45Z","updated_at":"2026-06-28T11:29:45Z","body":"it's happening because \"unsigned int last_mouse_monitor_mask\" at 212 line of display_server_x11 header is always 0 at the start of the engine. This triggers \"if (mask != last_mouse_monitor_mask)\" at 4839 line of \"display_server_x11.cpp\" because the mask is never equal zero. Only after this last_mouse_monitor_mask gets updated which prevents those closures later\n\nSo I did add check if the last_mouse_monitor_mask is zero and if so, we set this value to current mask value and that fixed the problem\n\n@bluebirdsan, can you add to the topic that it's related only to x11 server? Because I suppose that on the wayland it's already a different bug and PR docs recommend to bring only one change at the time\n\n<img width=\"687\" height=\"289\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3124b921-7552-4f15-b2ba-6020f08ba8f2\" />","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4825948619/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]